*.egg-info/
.Here is a comprehensive `.gitignore` file designed for a full-stack project combining **Python**, **FastAPI**, and **React** (whether using Vite or Create React App), along with common IDE and OS artifacts.

```gitignore
# ==========================================
# Operating System Files
# ==========================================
# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*
.Trashes

# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
*.stackdump
[Dd]esktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Linux
*~

